             25  *
             26  *       CALCULATE THE EXPONENTIAL VALUE OF
             27  *       E RAISED TO (ARG)
             28  *
             29  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
             30  *
             31  *       B @EXPF
             32  *
             33  *       IN  (R2) = ARG
             34  *       OUT (R2) = E ^ ARG
             35  *
             36  * EXCEPTIONS AND CONDITIONS:
             37  *
             38  *       ERROR 33 = EXP ARGUMENT TOO LARGE
             39  *       FLOATING POINT ERRORS
